{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Spoken Alarm 是一款會把鬧鐘訊息朗讀出來的 iPhone 工具，讓你以語音聽到提醒內容，而不是隻依賴單調的鈴聲。無論是提醒按時服藥、處理重要事項，還是需要更具提示性的起床鬧鐘，都相當實用。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，而且沒有訂閱、沒有廣告。</p>\n\n<h2>無廣告無訂閱的語音鬧鐘</h2>\n<p>你可以用麥克風錄下自己的聲音，或透過文字轉語音功能生成鬧鐘聲，讓響鬧時播出指定語句。鬧鐘可設定每日重複，亦可只在指定日子響起。程式完整支援以 Siri 設定鬧鐘，說出指令後再依提示回答即可。對於服藥時間等重要提醒，它提供完整鬧鐘功能。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Spoken Alarm</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T18:18:21.036404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}